      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "APEX GENERATOR v8\n\nOne saved PNG per run (LC Save Image). Pixaroma LoRA stack applies the LoRAs; Apex Recipe (live stack) reads that same stack from the queued graph and writes <lora:name:model:clip> tags so Civitai links every LoRA at its exact strength. Apex Generate holds steps/cfg/sampler/scheduler once and feeds the same values to the metadata saver.\n\nTEST ON YOUR MACHINE: one generation, then drop the PNG into the Refine stage."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "APEX GENERATOR v8\n\nOne saved PNG per run (LC Save Image). Pixaroma LoRA stack applies the LoRAs; Apex Recipe (live stack) reads that same stack from the queued graph and writes <lora:name:model:clip> tags so Civitai links every LoRA at its exact strength. Apex Generate holds steps/cfg/sampler/scheduler once and feeds the same values to the metadata saver.\n\nTEST ON YOUR MACHINE: one generation, then drop the PNG into the Refine stage."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
